= render "titles", text: "help.clubs"

.row

  .col-lg-6
    .panel.panel-pastel-info.no-margin
      .panel-body
        %h4.no-margin
          %strong
            Only club secretaries can edit club details
        .voffset1
          If your club secretary is unable to view below functionality,
          contact the
          = mail_to "webmaster@icu.ie"
          to check that your secretary information is up-to-date.
        .voffset1
          If you were recently added as secretary, sign out & in again to refresh the menu.

  .col-lg-12
    %h3 Edit your Club

    %ol
      %li
        = link_to "Sign in", sign_in_path
        to your ICU account.
      %li
        Open the
        %em= t("club.clubs")
        menu in the top navigation bar and select your club under
        = succeed(".") do
          %em= t("club.manage_clubs")
      %li Update the club details and meetings as needed.
      %li
        Click
        %em= t("save")
        and review the updated club page.

    %p
      You can also open your club's page from the directory and click the
      %em Edit Club
      button.

    %h3 Club Details

    %ul
      %li Name and website.
      %li
        Address, city, county and Eircode.
        %br
        %em Clubs without Latitude & longitude information won't appear on the directory map.
      %li Contact name, email address and phone number.
      %li Notes about the club, such as facilities, membership fees or information for visitors.
      %li Active status, which controls whether the club appears in the public directory.

    %p
      Use
      %em= t("club.meetings.add")
      to add a meeting. Set its day, start time, whether juniors are welcome and any audience restrictions.
      You can edit existing meetings or remove meetings that no longer take place.
      Click
      %em= t("save")
      to save these changes.

    %h3 Change the Club Secretary

    %ol
      %li
        In the edit form, use the
        %em Select Secretary
        button to pick the ICU ID of your new club secretary
      %li
        Click
        %em= t("save")
        and that user will now be the club secretary
    %p
      %strong
        A club can have only one secretary.
      By choosing a new secretary, you will no longer have access to edit your club.
